        "main.ino": "// This board joins the AP and drives its wired LED.\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(2, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  WiFi.begin(\"CircuitLab\", \"learn1234\", 6);\n  UDP.begin(4210);\n}\nvoid loop() {\n  if (UDP.parsePacket()) {\n    String message = UDP.readString();\n    digitalWrite(2, message == \"1\");\n    Serial.println(message);\n  }\n  delay(1);\n}\n"
